        "start": 0.2,
        "end": 5.5,
        "text": "April, 1241. Europe is about to face the Mongols."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip1B",
    "duration": 11.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 1,
        "end": 3,
        "text": "Grandsons of Genghis Khan..."
      },
      {
        "start": 3.2,
        "end": 6,
        "text": "You already burned Beijing to the ground. Why are you here?"
      },
      {
        "start": 7,
        "end": 9.5,
        "text": "The world is not so easily finished."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip2",
    "duration": 12.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 0.5,
        "end": 2.5,
        "text": "Duke Henry the Second. He's leading them."
      },
      {
        "start": 3,
        "end": 4.5,
        "text": "How many are we fighting?"
      },
      {
        "start": 5,
        "end": 6.2,
        "text": "Enough."
      },
      {
        "start": 9,
        "end": 10.8,
        "text": "Hold the line!"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip3",
    "duration": 12.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 0.3,
        "end": 1.4,
        "text": "They're moving—"
      },
      {
        "start": 5,
        "end": 6.6,
        "text": "Wait— they're retreating?"
      },
      {
        "start": 7.5,
        "end": 11.6,
        "text": "No. Watch. This is what they do — they lure you into chasing them, then they turn back and finish you."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip4",
    "duration": 5.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 0.5,
        "end": 2,
        "text": "They're fleeing! After them!"
      },
      {
        "start": 2.3,
        "end": 4.2,
        "text": "No— don't chase them!"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip5",
    "duration": 11.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 3.5,
        "end": 8,
        "text": "They pulled them straight out of formation. Just like I told them—"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip6",
    "duration": 4.041667,
    "captions": []
  },
  {
    "id": "clip7",
    "duration": 6.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 1,
        "end": 4.8,
        "text": "They aren't fighting us head-on—they're SURROUNDING us!"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip8",
    "duration": 6.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 1,
        "end": 4.8,
        "text": "Henry's still fighting... they're surrounding him."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip9",
    "duration": 13.041667,
    "captions": [
      {
        "start": 1.0,
        "end": 4.0,
        "text": "He's holding them off alone— like nothing can touch him—"
      },
      {
        "start": 7.5,
        "end": 9.0,
        "text": "No— no, no, no—"
      },
      {
        "start": 11.5,
        "end": 13.0,
        "text": "Henry... Henry's dead."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "clip10B",
    "duration": 9.041667,
